  "prefLabel": "Ahp 213.05 Closing the Record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ahp 213.05 Closing the Record. After the conclusion of the hearing and the filing of such post-hearing submissions as may be ordered by the presiding officer, the record shall be closed and no additional evidence shall be received into the record except as allowed by Ahp 213.06.\n\nSource. #8078, eff 5-1-04",
